Malis's family go camping in Mondulkiri, don't they? They arrive at the campsite and push the tent pegs into the ground. Malis wears her new hiking boots. Dad cooks rice on the camping stove, and Malis collects firewood. At night, everyone uses a head torch, bug spray and a mosquito net. Camping is fun, isn't it?

